"pūt"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தியோ","tr":"tiyō"}]},{"text":"வொல்லையூர்","tr":"vollaiyūr","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வொல்","tr":"vol"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யூர்","tr":"yūr"}]},{"text":"நாட்டே","tr":"nāṭṭē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நாட்","tr":"nāṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டே","tr":"ṭē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"இளையோர்","parts":[{"text":"இளையோர்","lemma":"இளையோர்","gloss":"young people"}],"gloss":"young people"},{"surface":"சூடார்","parts":[{"text":"சூடார்","lemma":"சூடு","gloss":"will not wear"}],"gloss":"will not wear"},{"surface":"வளையோர்","parts":[{"text":"வளையோர்","lemma":"வளையோர்","gloss":"women wearing bangles"}],"gloss":"women wearing bangles"},{"surface":"கொய்யார்","parts":[{"text":"கொய்யார்","lemma":"கொய்","gloss":"will not pluck"}],"gloss":"will not pluck"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"good"}],"gloss":"good"},{"surface":"யாழ்","parts":[{"text":"யாழ்","lemma":"யாழ்","gloss":"lute"}],"gloss":"lute"},{"surface":"மருப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"மருப்பு","lemma":"மருப்பு","gloss":"horn/peg"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"oblique/locative suffix"}],"gloss":"from the horn/peg"},{"surface":"மெல்ல","parts":[{"text":"மெல்ல","lemma":"மெல்ல","gloss":"gently"}],"gloss":"gently"},{"surface":"வாங்கி","parts":[{"text":"வாங்கி","lemma":"வாங்கு","gloss":"bending/pulling"}],"gloss":"bending"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பாணன்","parts":[{"text":"பாணன்","lemma":"பாணன்","gloss":"male bard"}],"gloss":"male bard"},{"surface":"சூடான்","parts":[{"text":"சூடான்","lemma":"சூடு","gloss":"will not wear"}],"gloss":"will not wear"},{"surface":"பாடினி","parts":[{"text":"பாடினி","lemma":"பாடினி","gloss":"female bard"}],"gloss":"female bard"},{"surface":"அணியாள்","parts":[{"text":"அணியாள்","lemma":"அணி","gloss":"will not adorn"}],"gloss":"will not adorn"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆண்மை","parts":[{"text":"ஆண்மை","lemma":"ஆண்மை","gloss":"manliness"}],"gloss":"manliness"},{"surface":"தோன்ற","parts":[{"text":"தோன்ற","lemma":"தோன்று","gloss":"to appear"}],"gloss":"visibly / so as to appear"},{"surface":"ஆடவர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆடவர்","lemma":"ஆடவர்","gloss":"men/warriors"}],"gloss":"men/warriors"},{"surface":"கடந்த","parts":[{"text":"கடந்த","lemma":"கட","gloss":"who overcame/conquered"}],"gloss":"who overcame/conquered"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வல்","parts":[{"text":"வல்","lemma":"வல்","gloss":"strong"}],"gloss":"strong"},{"surface":"வேல்","parts":[{"text":"வேல்","lemma":"வேல்","gloss":"spear"}],"gloss":"spear"},{"surface":"சாத்தன்","parts":[{"text":"சாத்தன்","lemma":"சாத்தன்","gloss":"Sathan"}],"gloss":"Sathan"},{"surface":"மாய்ந்த","parts":[{"text":"மாய்ந்த","lemma":"மாய்","gloss":"who died"}],"gloss":"who died"},{"surface":"பின்றை","parts":[{"text":"பின்றை","lemma":"பின்றை","gloss":"after"}],"gloss":"after"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முல்லையும்","parts":[{"text":"முல்லை","lemma":"முல்லை","gloss":"jasmine"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even/also"}],"gloss":"even the jasmine"},{"surface":"பூத்தியோ","parts":[{"text":"பூத்தி","lemma":"பூ","gloss":"you bloomed"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"interrogative particle"}],"gloss":"do you bloom?"},{"surface":"ஒல்லையூர்","parts":[{"text":"ஒல்லையூர்","lemma":"ஒல்லையூர்","gloss":"Ollaiyur"}],"gloss":"Ollaiyur"},{"surface":"நாட்டு","parts":[{"text":"நாட்டு","lemma":"நாட்டு","gloss":"of the land"}],"gloss":"of the land","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis/vocative"}],"gloss":"oh!"}]}],"literal":"Young men will not wear, women with bangles will not pluck / gently pulling down the arm of the good lute / the male bard will not wear, the female bard will not adorn / so that manliness appeared, overcoming other men / after Sathan of the strong spear died / do you still bloom, oh jasmine, in the land of Ollaiyur?","translation":"Young men will no longer wear you; women with bangles will no longer pluck you. Gently bending the arm of the fine lute, the bard will not wear you, nor will the songstress adorn herself. Now that Sathan of the mighty spear, who conquered other warriors to make his valor shine, has died, how can you still bloom, oh jasmine, in this land of Ollaiyur?","modern":"இளைஞர்கள் உன்னைச் சூடமாட்டார்கள்; வளையல் அணிந்த பெண்கள் உன்னைக் கொய்யமாட்டார்கள். நல்ல யாழின் தண்டை மெல்ல வளைத்து, பாணன் உன்னைச் சூடமாட்டான்; பாடினியும் உன்னை அணியமாட்டாள். தன் ஆண்மை வெளிப்படுமாறு பகை வீரர்களை வென்ற வலிமையான வேலைக் கொண்ட சாத்தன் இறந்த பிறகு, ஒல்லையூர் நாட்டில் முல்லைப் பூவே! நீ இன்னும் மலர்கின்றாயோ?","explanation":"This poem is set in the Puram genre under the theme of 'Kaiyaru Nilai' (grief over death), composed by Kudavayil Keerathanar on the death of Peruñcāttaṉ, the chief of Ollaiyūr. The poet addresses the wild jasmine (mullai) flower blooming in the land of Ollaiyur after the death of its heroic leader. He laments that since the great warrior Sathan, who proved his valor in battle, has passed away, there is no one left to appreciate or wear the jasmine. Young men, women, bards, and songstresses have all abandoned wearing flowers in their deep mourning. The poet asks the jasmine flower with poignant grief how it can still heartlessly bloom when the entire land is in sorrow.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.3],[1.3,1.7],[1.7,2.8],[2.8,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,3.7],[3.7,4.8],[4.8,5.2],[5.2,5.5],[5.5,6.1],[6.1,6.7],[6.7,7.1],[7.1,7.3],[7.3,7.7],[7.7,9.0],[9.0,9.0],[9.0,9.4],[9.4,9.8],[9.8,11.2],[11.2,11.5],[11.5,11.6],[11.6,12.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.2],[1.2,1.7],[1.7,2.9],[2.9,3.0],[3.0,3.5],[3.5,3.8],[3.8,3.8],[3.8,5.7],[5.7,6.1],[6.1,6.7],[6.7,7.5],[7.5,7.8],[7.8,8.0],[8.0,8.7],[8.7,10.1],[10.1,10.2],[10.2,10.6],[10.6,11.0],[11.0,12.6],[12.6,13.0],[13.0,13.1],[13.1,13.7]]}}